    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Parala.!<br><br>The land of order and friendship<br>Everything was good in Parala. Everyone was happy.!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434100/extras/dfedc1528959efeb93ee8ad5fb907cff.avif?t=1701881118\" /></span><br><br>Until...<br>Monti woke up in a mysterious desert and doesn't remember where she is. You as a player are here to uncover the mysterious world of Parala and help Monti on her journey to the depth of this world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434100/extras/5cef372a3985d4203a06c060517c6e61.avif?t=1701881118\" /></span><br><br>Parala has:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different maps and visuals</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Great musics</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging gameplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>And enemies of course.!</li></ul><br><br>So what will happen if you leave Parala? The answer seems scary.! It's all about you now.! Will you jump in?!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434100/extras/27597ba30732b6855504e86c4ed3caa6.avif?t=1701881118\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Parala.!<br><br>The land of order and friendship<br>Everything was good in Parala. Everyone was happy.!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434100/extras/dfedc1528959efeb93ee8ad5fb907cff.avif?t=1701881118\" /></span><br><br>Until...<br>Monti woke up in a mysterious desert and doesn't remember where she is. You as a player are here to uncover the mysterious world of Parala and help Monti on her journey to the depth of this world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434100/extras/5cef372a3985d4203a06c060517c6e61.avif?t=1701881118\" /></span><br><br>Parala has:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different maps and visuals</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Great musics</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging gameplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>And enemies of course.!</li></ul><br><br>So what will happen if you leave Parala? The answer seems scary.! It's all about you now.! Will you jump in?!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434100/extras/27597ba30732b6855504e86c4ed3caa6.avif?t=1701881118\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "Monti: The Hidden Secret is an action-advanture game set in the world of &quot;Parala&quot; follow her to the journey to find her destiny. Will she uncover the secret of the world?",
